Package: task-aprs
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: T.A.S.K. Development Team <TBD-maintainer-email>
Installed-Size: 73
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyside6.qtcore (>= 6.8), python3-pyside6.qtgui (>= 6.8), python3-pyside6.qtwidgets (>= 6.8), python3-task-comms (>= 0.3.0)
Recommends: direwolf
Suggests: task-launcher (>= 0.3.0)
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Description: T.A.S.K. APRS (amateur via Direwolf) and GMRS data profile
 Two-way amateur APRS through an already running Direwolf (AGW/KISS on loopback); never
 starts or configures Direwolf. Every transmission is an explicit user action checked by the
 transmit policy and audited. GMRS data only through a radio-integration driver; no verified
 real GMRS driver exists yet (SIMULATION driver only).
